00:27:23.720 --> 00:27:24.320
Agrega alguien al grupo

00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:25.080
y la licencia recae

00:27:25.080 --> 00:27:25.720
sobre esa persona.

00:27:25.720 --> 00:27:26.960
